{{wikipedia|Goldeneye (duck)}}
==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɡɘʊldn̩.ɑɪ/|lang=en}}

===Etymology===
From [[golden]] + [[eye]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of several [[seaduck]]s, of the [[genus]] ''[[Bucephala]]'', having black and white [[plumage]].
# Any of several [[lacewing]]s of the [[family]] ''[[Chrysopidae]]''.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|seaduck}} [[whistler]]
* {{sense|fly}} [[golden-eyed fly]]

====Derived terms====
* [[Barrow's Goldeneye]], ''Bucephala islandica''
* [[Common Goldeneye]], ''Bucephala clangula''

